    /// Everyone in the device household, owner first, then adults, then kids.
    ///
    /// A profile may be in several households: a kid shared with another
    /// household stands in each alike, and an adult of another household
    /// may be `present` here. Pending adults are listed only while the
    /// owner is the active profile, with the expiry of their usable join
    /// code. What the active profile may do follows from
    /// `Me.household.adultId` and kinds: any adult of the household edits
    /// kids and their PINs; each adult sets their own PIN; only the owner
    /// adds adults, resends a pending adult's code, removes any member
    /// other than themselves, and makes a kid an adult. No adult is ever
    /// made a kid. A kid may do none of it, and neither may a present
