    /// The profile's own playlists and those shared with it, by name.
    ///
    /// A playlist belongs to one adult's profile and holds one library
    /// kind: movies, tv or music. Its owner may share it with other
    /// profiles (listPlaylistShares) and with households
    /// (listPlaylistHouseholdShares); it is then listed for everyone it
    /// reaches too, with access and ownerName. A kid owns none, so a
    /// kid's page holds only playlists shared with the kid or a
    /// household of theirs. A playlist a station owns is
    /// not listed. Another household's
    /// profile is not found, and other profiles answer 403 while a kid is
    /// active.
    ///
