    /// Claims many titles' files for the profile on this device, in order.
    ///
    /// Claims each title as createDownload claims it, at the one quality
    /// and snapshot given, in request order, so the conversions they need
    /// queue in that order for this device. A title already claimed
    /// answers the same download, in its place in the queue.
    ///
    /// Each title answers on its own, in request order: download, or error
    /// with the code and message createDownload would answer: not_found
    /// for a title the profile may not see or that does not exist, or an
    /// edition of another item, bad_request for an item that is no title,
    /// conflict for a title with no file on disk this device can keep.
    /// One title's error claims the others all the same.
